<p> Yr/yr change			-9.0	-8.6	 (-8.6)</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		 101.6	103.0	(103.0)</p>
<p>INPUT PRICES (MATERIALS AND FUEL) (adj)</p>
<p> Monthly change		    -0.4	-0.8	 (-0.8)</p>
<p> Yr/yr change			-8.9	-8.6	 (-8.4)</p>
<p> Index				 102.8     103.2	(103.2)</p>
<p>INPUT PRICES EX F, D, T, P (unadj)</p>
<p> Monthly change		    -1.4	-0.4	 (-0.3)</p>
